Ruliology.CellularAutomata.Rule30PeriodicBirthCounterexample.physical_recurrence (t p : Int) :
  Ruliology.CellularAutomata.Rule30PeriodicBirthCounterexample.orbit (t + 1) p =
    Ruliology.CellularAutomata.Rule30Jen.rule
      (Ruliology.CellularAutomata.Rule30PeriodicBirthCounterexample.orbit t (p - 1))
      (Ruliology.CellularAutomata.Rule30PeriodicBirthCounterexample.orbit t p)
      (Ruliology.CellularAutomata.Rule30PeriodicBirthCounterexample.orbit t (p + 1))
'Ruliology.CellularAutomata.Rule30PeriodicBirthCounterexample.physical_recurrence' depends on axioms: [propext,
 Quot.sound]
